@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 120
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

 title Sequence - Pipeline de maintenance predictive

 actor "Planificateur / Capteur" as Source
 participant "DatasetReplayEngine" as Replay
 participant "MachineStreamingService" as Streaming
 database "PostgreSQL" as DB
 participant "MLServiceClient" as MlClient
 participant "FastAPI\nService ML" as FastAPI
 participant "AlertDecisionEngine" as Decision
 participant "AlertService" as Alerts
 participant "NotificationService" as Notify
 participant "Angular Frontend" as Frontend

== Acquisition et prediction ==

Source -> Streaming : declencher un tick de streaming
activate Streaming
Streaming -> DB : findAll machines
DB --> Streaming : liste des machines

loop pour chaque machine
    Streaming -> Replay : advanceMachine(machine)
    Replay --> Streaming : frame capteur + etat de sante

    alt aucune donnee disponible
        Streaming --> Source : ignorer la machine
    else donnee disponible
        Streaming -> DB : save(sensorTelemetry)
        DB --> Streaming : telemetrie sauvegardee

        Streaming -> MlClient : getPrediction(machineId, telemetry)
        activate MlClient
        MlClient -> FastAPI : POST /predict\nX-Internal-Key + donnees capteurs
        activate FastAPI

        alt service ML disponible
            FastAPI --> MlClient : prediction RUL, anomalie, risque
        else erreur reseau ou ML indisponible
            FastAPI --> MlClient : erreur / timeout
            MlClient --> MlClient : calcul de la prediction fallback
        end
        deactivate FastAPI
        MlClient --> Streaming : prediction normalisee
        deactivate MlClient

        Streaming -> DB : update machine health
        Streaming -> DB : save prediction history

        Streaming -> Decision : decide(health, RUL, anomalie, risque)
        Decision --> Streaming : niveau + titre + recommandation

        alt severite INFO
            Streaming -> Frontend : STOMP /topic/machines\ntelemetrie enrichie
        else aucun incident actif
            Streaming -> Alerts : openIncident(...)
            activate Alerts
            Alerts -> DB : inserer incident actif
            DB --> Alerts : incident cree
            Alerts -> Notify : notifier les responsables
            Notify --> Alerts : notification envoyee
            Alerts --> Streaming : incident ouvert
            deactivate Alerts
            Streaming -> Frontend : STOMP /topic/machines\nSTOMP /topic/alerts
        else incident actif avec severite modifiee
            Streaming -> Alerts : updateIncidentSeverity(...)
            Alerts -> DB : mettre a jour l'incident
            DB --> Alerts : incident mis a jour
            Alerts --> Streaming : incident actualise
            Streaming -> Frontend : STOMP /topic/machines\nSTOMP /topic/alerts
        else incident actif sans changement
            Streaming -> Frontend : STOMP /topic/machines\ntelemetrie enrichie
        end
    end
end

Streaming --> Source : tick termine
 deactivate Streaming

note over Source, Frontend
Le frontend peut aussi appeler POST /api/v1/machines/{machineId}/telemetry :
la sequence reutilise la normalisation, MlPredictionService, la persistance
et le retour HTTP de la prediction.
end note

@enduml
